<https://w3id.org/estleg/ABIPOL_Par_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/estleg/ABIPOL_Par_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/estleg/LegalProvision_abipolitseiniku_seadus> .
<https://w3id.org/estleg/ABIPOL_Par_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "§ 1. Seaduse reguleerimisala" .
<https://w3id.org/estleg/ABIPOL_Par_1> <https://w3id.org/estleg/hasSubsection> <https://w3id.org/estleg/ABIPOL_Par_1_Lg_1> .
