<https://w3id.org/estleg/ABIPOL_Par_28> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "§ 28. Vahetu sunni kohaldamine" .
<https://w3id.org/estleg/ABIPOL_Par_28> <https://w3id.org/estleg/hasSubsection> <https://w3id.org/estleg/ABIPOL_Par_28_Lg_1> .
