<https://w3id.org/estleg/ABIPOL_Par_5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "§ 5. Isikud, keda võetakse abipolitseinikuks" .
<https://w3id.org/estleg/ABIPOL_Par_5> <https://w3id.org/estleg/hasSubsection> <https://w3id.org/estleg/ABIPOL_Par_5_Lg_Unknown_1> .
